- 6 men can complete a piece of work in 12 days 8 women can complete the same piece of work in 18 days whereas 18 children can complete the piece of work in 10 days. 4men, 12 women and 20 children work together for 2 days. If only men were to complete the remaining work in 1 day how many men would be required totally? {link:https://youtu.be/MvOfmFR-s78?t=2185}@@Link@@{/}

